---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const pageTitle = "Terms of Use | TrueBridge";
const description =
  "Review the general terms and conditions for using the TrueBridge website.";
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} {description}>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="bg-canvas py-14 lg:py-20" aria-labelledby="tou-hero-heading">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-[900px] px-5 text-left sm:px-6 lg:px-10">
        <h1
          id="tou-hero-heading"
          class="mb-6 font-display text-5xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-ink md:text-6xl"
        >
          Terms of Use
        </h1>
        <p class="max-w-[760px] text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-xl">
          These terms explain general conditions for using the TrueBridge website.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-paper py-14 lg:py-20" aria-label="Terms of Use details">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-[900px] px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-10">
        <p class="mb-1 text-lg font-semibold leading-snug tracking-tight text-ink">TERMS OF USE</p>
        <p class="mb-10 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-xl">Last updated: May 12, 2026</p>

        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          These Terms of Use apply to your use of the TrueBridge website. By using this website, you agree to use it only for lawful
          and appropriate purposes.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-0 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          1. Informational purposes only
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          The information on this website is provided for general informational purposes. It is not medical advice, mental health advice,
          diagnosis, treatment, or a substitute for professional care.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          2. No therapist-client relationship
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          Using this website, reading information on the website, submitting a contact request, sending an email, leaving a voicemail, or
          scheduling a consultation does not automatically create a therapist-client relationship.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          A therapist-client relationship is established only after appropriate intake, consent, fit, scheduling, and clinical requirements
          have been completed.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          3. Emergencies and crisis situations
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          This website is not monitored for emergencies. Do not use this website, email, voicemail, or general contact tools for urgent
          clinical needs or emergencies.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          If you are in immediate danger or experiencing a mental health crisis, call 988 or 911 or go to the nearest emergency room.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">
          4. Services and availability
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          Information about services, clinician availability, insurance participation, rates, and scheduling may change. TrueBridge does
          not guarantee that a specific service, clinician, appointment time, or payment option will be available.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">5. Website content</h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          We make reasonable efforts to keep website information accurate and current, but we do not guarantee that all information is
          complete, current, or error-free.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">6. External links</h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          This website may contain links to third-party websites or services. TrueBridge is not responsible for the content, privacy
          practices, security, or availability of external websites.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">7. Appropriate use</h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          You agree not to misuse the website, interfere with its operation, attempt unauthorized access, submit harmful code, or use the
          website for unlawful purposes.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">8. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          TrueBridge may update these Terms of Use from time to time. The current version will be posted on this website.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mb-4 mt-12 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-4xl">9. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mb-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted md:text-lg">
          If you have questions about these Terms of Use, please contact TrueBridge.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
